{"role": "user", "text": "? Memory Architecture (models.py, memory/store.py)\n  - Fact, Reflection, MessageRecord\n  - Importance scoring, decay functions\n  - Retrieval budget manager\n  - SQLite + JSONL storage\n\n  ? Storage Layer (storage/)\n  - sqlite_db.py\n  - jsonl.py utilities\n  - Legacy file storage\n\n  ? Text Processing (memory/)\n  - text_sim.py (n-gram similarity)\n  - importance.py (scoring, decay)\n\n  ? Document Processing (documents.py)\n  - PDF, DOCX, TXT extraction\n  - Encoding detection\n\n  ��� ����� ��������:\n\n  ? LLM Client (llm/client.py)\n  �������: Google Gemini API\n  client = genai.Client(api_key=GOOGLE_API_KEY)\n\n  ��� OpenAI:\n  from openai import OpenAI\n  client = OpenAI(api_key=OPENAI_API_KEY)\n\n  def oneshot(prompt: str, model: str = \"gpt-4\") -> str:\n      response = client.chat.completions.create(\n          model=model,\n          messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": prompt}]\n      )\n      return response.choices[0].message.content\n\n  ��� Anthropic Claude:\n  from anthropic import Anthropic\n  client = Anthropic(api_key=ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)\n\n  def oneshot(prompt: str, model: str = \"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022\") -> str:\n      response = client.messages.create(\n          model=model,\n          max_tokens=4096,\n          messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": prompt}]\n      )\n      return response.content[0].text\n\n  ? Session Management (llm/sessions.py)\n  �������� Gemini client.chats.create() ��:\n  - OpenAI: ������� messages list, ���������� � API\n  - Anthropic: �� �� �����\n  - LangChain: ConversationChain � memory\n\n  ? Grounding/Search (llm/grounding.py)\n  �������: Google Search ����� Gemini API\n\n  ������������:\n  - Perplexity API\n  - Bing Search API + RAG\n  - Tavily Search\n  - SerpAPI + LLM synthesis\n\n  ? System Prompts (llm/prompts.py)\n  - ������������ ��� style guide ������ LLM\n  - OpenAI: ����� ���������� ���\n  - Claude: ������������ ������\n  - Llama: ������� �������\n\n  ? Media Processing\n  �������: Gemini vision API ��� ����/�����\n\n  ������������:\n  - OpenAI GPT-4 Vision\n  - Claude 3.5 Sonnet vision\n  - LLaVA (open-source)\n\n  ��������� (Telegram ? ������ ���������):\n\n  ? handlers.py - Telegram-����������� ���\n\n  ��� Discord:\n  import discord\n  from discord.ext import commands\n\n  bot = commands.Bot(command_prefix='/')\n\n  @bot.command()\n  async def facts(ctx, *, query: str = None):\n      # �� �� ������, ������ API\n      ...\n\n  ��� Web UI:\n  from fastapi import FastAPI, WebSocket\n\n  app = FastAPI()\n\n  @app.websocket(\"/chat\")\n  async def chat_endpoint(websocket: WebSocket):\n      await websocket.accept()\n      while True:\n          data = await websocket.receive_text()\n          response = await process_llm_request(user_id, data)\n          await websocket.send_text(response)\n\n  ��� CLI:\n  import asyncio\n  from prompt_toolkit import PromptSession\n\n  async def main():\n      session = PromptSession()\n      while True:\n          user_input = await session.prompt_async('> ')\n          response = await process_llm_request(USER_ID, user_input)\n          print(response)\n\n  ---\n  ? �������� ������������ �����������:\n\n  1. Modular Design - ���� �����������, ����� �������� LLM ����������\n  2. Memory Persistence - SQLite + JSONL = ���������� + audit trail\n  3. Importance-based Retrieval - ����������� ��������, � �� ���� ����\n  4. Consolidation Pipeline - ������ ������ ������������, � �� �������\n  5. Multi-personality Support - Anya ��� proof of concept ��� multiple agents\n  6. Crisis Detection - �������� value ��� mental health companion\n  7. Dual Storage - ACID �������� + immutable audit log\n  8. Russian Language Support - n-gram similarity �������� � �����������\n  9. Feedback Loop Prevention - personality �� ����������� �� ��������\n  10. Race Condition Protection - concurrent updates ���������\n\n  ---\n  ? ��������� ���������:\n\n  ������������� (1-2 ���):\n\n  - [ ] FTS5 ��� facts sea